WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.237
Welcome to the Game Master orientation.

00:00:03.237 --> 00:00:07.287
Establish the session, verify the participant topology, maintain

00:00:07.287 --> 00:00:10.700
operator continuity, and export a trustworthy record of the

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.200
completed run.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.938
Treat administration as an evidence chain.

00:00:14.938 --> 00:00:18.988
Establish the correct session, verify the participant topology,

00:00:18.988 --> 00:00:23.000
monitor operational continuity, and export only from the selected

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.762
run.

00:00:24.335 --> 00:00:28.110
Live exercise control remains with White Cell, so use

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:31.735
this surface to verify and preserve context rather than to

00:00:31.735 --> 00:00:33.160
infer decisions.
